From 02c23ca328167b5e1944491fb04ed01bfd24de17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:55:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0146: screens beyond 255. NUM_SCREENS 1024 (ids.h); a
 screen 255.. is a sector of SCRN.DAT (screen.h, mod_screen.c): its
 MAP_ENTRIES row, own toilet/door/caption, flags (concave, mist, shop, arena)
 and its MAPHEAD section as a script of its own, read when the screen is named
 and cached (4 heads + 1 sector); WORLD_POOP screens are ScreenId
 (SAVE_TAG_POOP_MAPS authoritative); the light table compares the whole screen
 id; a save on a screen >= 255 refuses the original

